          {
            "title": "Descriptive names",
            "id": 87014,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dar nomes descritivos às funções, como <code>get_final_price</code>, nos ajuda a saber de imediato o que elas fazem.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_final_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price, tax)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price + tax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"price = get_final_price(\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"price\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"31.5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>get_final_price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nomes descritivos ajudam você a entender o que uma função faz.</p><p>Dê à função um nome que descreva a obtenção do preço final e use o mesmo nome na chamada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_final_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price, tax)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price + tax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"price = get_final_price(\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"price\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"31.5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>get_final_price</code> seguido de <code>get_final_price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Verb",
            "id": 87015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Funções são ações, então seus nomes geralmente começam com um verbo, como aqui com <code>create</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"create_email\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name + \" /><text value=\"&quot;@hutmail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"email = create_email(\" /><text value=\"&quot;jo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(email)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"10\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"jo@hutmail.com\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>create</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Functions that return values",
            "id": 87017,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Funções que retornam valores geralmente começam com verbos como <code>get</code> como em <code>get_telephone</code>, <code>compute</code>, ou <code>calculate</code> como <code>calculate_sum</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_telephone\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(prefix, number)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prefix + number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 + num_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>get</code> seguido de <code>calculate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Function that returns booleans",
            "id": 87018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como um caso especial, funções que retornam valores booleanos frequentemente começam com <code>is</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"is_freezing\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(temperature)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"freezing = is_freezing(\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(freezing)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>is</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Funções que retornam booleanos geralmente começam com <code>is</code>.</p><p>Siga essa prática de nomenclatura e escolha uma temperatura que faça o código imprimir <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"is_freezing\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(temperature)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"freezing = is_freezing(\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(freezing)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>is</code> seguido de <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Same naming practice",
            "id": 87019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A chave é manter a mesma prática de nomenclatura para funções que realizam uma tarefa semelhante, como <code>calculate_sum</code> e <code>calculate_difference</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 + num_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_difference\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 - num_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>calculate</code> seguido de <code>calculate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mantenha a mesma prática de nomenclatura para funções que realizam tarefas semelhantes.</p><p>Use o prefixo <code>calculate</code> nos dois nomes e associe cada nome ao cálculo realizado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 + num_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_difference\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 - num_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_sum\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get_difference\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>calculate_sum</code> seguido de <code>calculate_difference</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Descriptive names",
            "id": 87020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que é importante dar nomes descritivos às funções?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para saber de relance o que a função faz</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para evitar obter um erro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para saber de relance o que a função faz.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nomes descritivos de funções nos permitem saber de relance o que uma função faz.</p><p>Tanto <code>send_email()</code> quanto <code>task()</code> funcionam sem erros. Por que <code>send_email()</code> é um nome mais claro?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele descreve o propósito da função sem precisarmos ler o corpo dela.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O Python rejeita nomes de funções que não descrevem seu propósito.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nomes de funções mais longos sempre fazem uma função executar mais rápido.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele descreve o propósito da função sem precisarmos ler o corpo dela.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Verb",
            "id": 87021,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com o que os nomes das funções geralmente começam?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Verbos como <code>create</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Substantivos como <code>first_name</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Verbos como <code>create</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nomes de funções geralmente começam com verbos, como <code>create</code>.</p><p>Qual nome combina melhor com uma função que cria um relatório?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>create_report()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>report()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>first_report()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>create_report()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Functions that return values",
            "id": 87023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais são alguns verbos que funções que retornam valores podem começar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code>, <code>get</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>has</code>, <code>is</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code>, <code>get</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Funções que retornam valores geralmente começam com verbos como <code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code> ou <code>get</code>.</p><p>Qual nome combina melhor com uma função que calcula e retorna o total de um pedido?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>calculate_total()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_total()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>total()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>calculate_total()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function that returns booleans",
            "id": 87024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais são alguns verbos que funções que retornam booleanos podem começar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>is</code>, <code>has</code>, <code>can</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get</code>, <code>make</code>, <code>calculate</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>is</code>, <code>has</code>, <code>can</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Funções que retornam booleanos geralmente começam com <code>is</code>, <code>has</code> ou <code>can</code>.</p><p>Qual nome combina melhor com uma função que retorna se um usuário tem acesso?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>has_access()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_access()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>calculate_access()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>has_access()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Same naming practice",
            "id": 87025,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que significa manter a mesma nomeação de função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usar o mesmo verbo para funções que realizam tarefas semelhantes</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usar o mesmo verbo independentemente do que as funções fazem</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usar o mesmo verbo para funções que realizam tarefas semelhantes.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nomes consistentes significam usar o mesmo verbo para funções que realizam tarefas semelhantes.</p><p>Um projeto tem <code>load_profile()</code>. Qual nome combina melhor com uma função parecida que carrega configurações?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>load_settings()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_settings()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>settings_load()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>load_settings()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Descriptive names",
            "id": 87026,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dê um nome descritivo a esta função que exibe um item e seu preço.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_item_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item, price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\": $\" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display_item_price(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_item\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"chocolate: $3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>display_item_price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esta função mostra um item e seu preço. Dê a ela um nome que mencione os dois e use o mesmo nome para chamá-la. Ela exibe <code>chocolate: $3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_item_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item, price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\": $\" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display_item_price(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_item\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"chocolate: $3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>display_item_price</code> seguido de <code>display_item_price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Verb",
            "id": 87027,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de que o nome desta função comece com um verbo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"generate_username\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, b_day)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"_\" /><text value=\"{b_day}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user = generate_username(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"ty_17\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>generate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O nome desta função deve começar com um verbo. Use o mesmo prefixo na chamada. Ela exibe <code>ty_17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"generate_username\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, b_day)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"_\" /><text value=\"{b_day}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user = generate_username(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"ty_17\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>generate</code> seguido de <code>generate</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Functions that return values",
            "id": 87032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique um nome para esta função que calcula os assentos livres restantes em uma apresentação.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_free_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(booked, total)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - booked\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"free = get_free_seats(\" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(free)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"has_free_seats\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>get_free_seats</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o nome descritivo da função e escolha os assentos reservados para o código imprimir <code>7</code> assentos livres.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_free_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(booked, total)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - booked\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"free = get_free_seats(\" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(free)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get_booked_seats\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>get_free_seats</code> seguido de <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Same naming practice",
            "id": 87034,
